🛡️ Mirage Spoofer v21.39

Naya **Anti-Root** update. Target apps ko Magisk / LSPosed / su folders kam dikhte hain.

## ✨ Kya naya hai

- 🛡️ **Anti-Root Mode** — su folders, Magisk/LSPosed APK list, aur maps file hide (Settings → Anti-Root)
- 🎯 **Auto stealth** — Home pe jo apps tick ho, unpe hide automatically lagta hai
- ⚡ **Plan unlock live** — admin activate kare to app band kiye bina unlock
- 🏠 **Home tez** — list har baar reload nahi hoti

## 📦 Install

1. Neeche se `Mirage_Spoofer_v21.39.apk` download karo  
2. Purani official app ke upar install karo  
3. **Mirage Helper v12** (zip) Magisk/KernelSU pe flash karo — bina Helper ke Anti-Root poora nahi chalega  
4. Reboot → Anti-Root **ON** → LSPosed me target apps scope me rakho

